  "instituteId": "iit-madras",
  "summary": {
    "text": "Student life at IIT Madras is organised around 20 river-named hostels that compete all year in inter-hostel literary, technical and sports leagues. The student-run Centre for Innovation houses a dozen tinkering clubs and competition teams, the Sangam umbrella runs the cultural and literary clubs, and January brings back-to-back flagship fests: Shaastra (technical) and Saarang (cultural). The wooded 617-acre campus, shared with deer and blackbuck, adds a very different backdrop to an engineering degree.",
